{"pageid": 956, "title": "Nosferatype", "revid": 2228, "categories": ["Lore", "Monsters", "Nosferatypes"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Nosferatype.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215001344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Nosferatype\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Nosferatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241215001344\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"284\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Nosferatype.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>Please note that these records must be updated with any further adaptations of the Nosferatype, as only time will tell what human culture and fears will morph them into next.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">The Book of Butcher</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Nosferatypes</b> are a breed of <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> fought by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. These monsters are those that feed on blood, fluids, or other energies of their victims, rather than simple meat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>While vampiric monsters have always existeed across the globe, the modern Nosferatype comes mainly from Eatern European folklore. The Nosferatypes were known to be incredibly powerful during the Bubonic Plague of the Middle Ages, which in turn caused them to often be associated with rats. \n</p><p>They are culturally considered the most famous of all monsters; however, recent sanitizations and reinterpretations of vampires in pop culture has dramatically decreased their populations. They were originally classified as <a href=\"/wiki/Mythotypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mythotypes\">Mythotypes</a> before their popularity shifted them into their own category.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BOB&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BOB-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Nosferatypes will not feed on the flesh of their victims, like the other types of monsters, but on other bodily fluids, usually blood or energy. Their victims will often be found perfectly intact, but emptied dry. Common Vampires will feed on blood instead of flesh, but other designations have other appetites.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classifications\">Classifications</span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Common Vampire</b> - feeds on blood.</li>\n<li><b>Psychic Vampire</b> - feeds on guilt, trauma, anger, despair, and other dark emotions.</li>\n<li><b>Succubus/Incubus</b> - feed on sexual energies and fluids.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Nosferatypes\">Notable Nosferatypes</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animatype_Totems\">Animatype Totems</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Nosferatype-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:117px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Nosferatype.png\" title=\"Nosferatype.png (1.86 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:117px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Nosferatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/117?cb=20241215001344\" title=\"Nosferatype.png (1.86 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Nosferatype.png (1.86 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-image-key=\"Nosferatype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b7/Nosferatype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/117?cb=20241215001344\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-BOB-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-BOB_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">Book of Butcher</a>,</i> vol. #1, <a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">issue no.1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2023.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:34+00:00"}